    "storyTitle": "Profile",
    "text": "A native of Sargon, Taraxacum is a wandering medical apprentice with considerable experience driving burdenbeast carts. He is currently stationed on Rhodes Island for academic exchange and study, providing everyday medical services on a temporary contract."
